OL,3,GNEWSAPay parity policy undermining
OL,4,Apublic services, research suggests
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe quality of Northern Ireland's
OL,7,Fpublic services is being undermined by
OL,8,Fa policy of matching public sector pay
OL,9,Fawards in England, research suggests.
OL,11,FThe Stormont Executive has a policy of
OL,12,F"pay parity" which means it aims to
OL,13,Fmatch annual percentage pay increases
OL,14,Fagreed in England.
OL,16,FThat has placed pressure on the
OL,17,FStormont budget because the unique
OL,18,Fstructure and size of Northern
OL,19,FIreland's public sector workforce means
OL,20,Fthose pay increases are not fully
OL,21,Fcovered by UK government funding.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,417,410,260,120,0,100
