OL,3,GNEWSAPay parity policy undermining
OL,4,Apublic services, research suggests
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe NI Fiscal Council suggests that to
OL,7,Ffund the pay awards, departments have
OL,8,Fsqueezed non-pay spending down to
OL,9,Flevels well below those in England.
